    <item>
      <title>永續紡織：環保回收聚酯原液染色纖維的創新應用</title>
      <link>https://docs-acelon-yarn.web.app/zh-tw/products/recycled-polyester-dope-dyed-color-yarn/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://docs-acelon-yarn.web.app/zh-tw/products/recycled-polyester-dope-dyed-color-yarn/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;環保回收聚酯原液染色纖維 AceColor®ECO 
    &lt;div id=&#34;環保回收聚酯原液染色纖維-acecoloreco&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#%e7%92%b0%e4%bf%9d%e5%9b%9e%e6%94%b6%e8%81%9a%e9%85%af%e5%8e%9f%e6%b6%b2%e6%9f%93%e8%89%b2%e7%ba%96%e7%b6%ad-acecoloreco&#34; aria-label=&#34;定位點&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AceColor®ECO 環保回收聚酯原液染色纖維，採用消費後回收的寶特瓶作為原料，透過再製過程賦予纖維顏色，省略傳統染色流程，減少產業中最具污染性與高能耗的環節。這項創新不僅有效減少廢棄物，還能大幅降低資源消耗與環境負擔。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
